==Notes==
This quest is only available during the time of [[Spring Eggstravaganza]].
==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:The Spring Eggstravaganza]] in order to do [[Quest:The Eggcellent Egg Hunt]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
==Goals==
One of Alyssa's eggs has been hidden somewhere in Sacred Grove and she needs you to find it.
*Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
*Return to Alyssa Eggelyn.
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"That dirty robgoblin did it again. When I went to count my eggs I found one was missing with a note from him saying he hid it again.<br />I need all of my eggs before the Spring Eggstravaganza, please use your special skills to find my missing egg." -Alyssa Eggelyn
#Find Alyssa Eggelyn's stolen egg.
#*The egg is located at the Northernmost point of the lake that borders the [[Blackspore Swamp]].
#Speak with [[Alyssa Eggelyn]] located in [[Pixiewood Hills]] in [[Sanctuary]].
#*"Hooray you found it and not a moment too soon. Thank you for helping me, please take this special egg that I saved for you to open on Spring Eggstravaganza day." -Alyssa Eggelyn
